{
  "name": "Payout Reconciler — 99 Error Notifier",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF99: Error Notifier\n\nFires on any unhandled error in WF01 (Payout Reconciler). Extracts execution context (which workflow, which node, error message, run ID), writes a row to `payment_recon.posting_events` with event_type 'ERROR' for the audit trail, sends a Slack alert to #recon-errors, and emails the operator.\n\n**Distinct from in-workflow FAILED events**: this catches UNEXPECTED errors (sandbox throws, Postgres connection drops, expression compile errors). Predictable failures (signature, validation, Xero 4xx/5xx) are handled inside WF01 with structured HTTP responses, not via this notifier.\n\n**Wiring**: set WF01's Error Workflow setting to this workflow's ID in Workflow Settings.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -48,
        -176
      ],
      "id": "08534fad-b845-477c-a84f-13d614e3993d",
      "name": "Header"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.errorTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        208,
        336
      ],
      "id": "5f7918c0-c119-4c6c-ad6b-4815274bbd80",
      "name": "Error Trigger"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
